{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person, point-and-click adventure set in a retro-futuristic, post-apocalyptic world where giant insects and abandoned robots reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/01_Helico_crash_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your time to explore and find your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/01_Molotov_Combo_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Combine specific items to create new ones in your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/02_K7_Pick_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Pick up items that can be used later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/03_Echelle_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/04_Scie_Drop_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive locations with realistic sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursor animations when hovering over hidden items in the scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clicking on interactive objects displays a hand-drawn sketch illustrating the expected action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect objects to use later in other scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop items on specific spots to trigger actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cinematic sequences triggered by player actions, advancing the story and unlocking new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine certain objects directly in the inventory to solve puzzles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301420?t=1753428204","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301420?t=1753428204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/6722cfe3a25190fa66611b2e7c320d3f2de315f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753428204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/6722cfe3a25190fa66611b2e7c320d3f2de315f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753428204","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains some gore (such as corpses)."},"demos":[{"appid":3801100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person, point-and-click adventure set in a retro-futuristic, post-apocalyptic world where giant insects and abandoned robots reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/01_Helico_crash_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your time to explore and find your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/01_Molotov_Combo_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Combine specific items to create new ones in your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/02_K7_Pick_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Pick up items that can be used later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/03_Echelle_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/04_Scie_Drop_.gif?t=1753428204\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive locations with realistic sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursor animations when hovering over hidden items in the scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clicking on interactive objects displays a hand-drawn sketch illustrating the expected action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect objects to use later in other scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop items on specific spots to trigger actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cinematic sequences triggered by player actions, advancing the story and unlocking new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine certain objects directly in the inventory to solve puzzles.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cryo Swamp"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/header.jpg?t=1753428204","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257089658,"mp4":{"480":"http:/